OL,3,GNEWSATrump's Irish unity remarks a
OL,4,A'dead cat' says DUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's comments
OL,7,Fsupporting Irish unity were part of a
OL,8,F"dead cat strategy", the leader of the
OL,9,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIt followed the president's comments
OL,13,Fthat he would love to see a united
OL,14,FIreland during a meeting with Taoiseach
OL,15,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin over the
OL,16,Fweekend.
OL,18,FGavin Robinson said the remarks had
OL,19,F"diverted everyone's attention" away
OL,20,Ffrom media focus in the Republic of
OL,21,FIreland on his stance over the Middle
OL,22,FEast.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
