OL,3,GNEWSATrump's Irish unity remarks a
OL,4,A'dead cat' says DUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe rejected suggestions that Trump's
OL,7,Fremarks were embarrassing for the DUP
OL,8,Fgiven the support some senior figures
OL,9,Fhave shown for the US president over
OL,10,Fmany years.
